# Legacy WordPress URLs -> current pages
# Preserves Search Console ranking signal for indexed top pages after the
# static-site migration. See Search Console "Top pages" for traffic data.
#
# Targets are the extensionless form (e.g. /warehouse-services, not
# /warehouse-services.html) because Cloudflare Pages itself 308-redirects
# every *.html request to its extensionless equivalent. Redirecting straight
# to that final destination avoids a redundant second hop through the .html
# URL; it's also the URL declared canonical in each page's <head> and in
# sitemap.xml, so this keeps redirects, canonicals, and the sitemap aligned.
/warehouse-services/               /warehouse-services               301
/cross-docking/                    /cross-docking                    301
/contact-us/                       /contact                          301
/fine-art-installation-and-removal/ /fine-art-installation-removal   301
/safe-secure-art-storage/          /safe-secure-art-storage          301
/get-started/                      /get-started                      301
/careers/                          /careers                          301
/small-local-moves-and-storage/    /small-local-moves-and-storage    301
/convention-storage/               /convention-storage                301
